.TH visibility 1  "visibility " 
.SH NAME
visibility \- Change a snippet\*(Aqs visibility: public|unlisted|private
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBvisibility\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> <\fIVISIBILITY\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change a snippet\*(Aqs visibility: public|unlisted|private
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Snippet name
.TP
<\fIVISIBILITY\fR>
The new visibility
